        "execSummary":  "Gemini 4 Argon\u0027s arrival in the Gemini app is Google\u0027s clearest move yet to position its frontier model as a daily productivity and workflow automation tool for professional users, not just a developer API. The task mode with 40+ connected app integrations is a direct challenge to Microsoft Copilot\u0027s ecosystem play and signals that Google sees agentic workflow orchestration — not just chat — as the core value proposition for AI subscriptions. For enterprise buyers evaluating Google Workspace AI, this means the gap between consumer-tier Gemini and enterprise-grade Copilot is narrowing. The caveat is that access is gated to paid AI Pro/Ultra tiers, and enterprise governance features such as data residency and audit logging are not addressed in this consumer-focused announcement.",
